# Urgent messages and prices

- Before any other answer, check the customer's message for the agreed urgent words. That list is the urgent-words file in the [project guide](../../AGENTS.md).
- If one of those words matches, reply with only the urgent reply text in the [project guide](../../AGENTS.md). Nothing comes before it or after it.
- Do not treat other wording as urgent.
- Do not treat the phone number in the urgent reply as a price.
- Never show a price that is not written on the business's public pages.
- When a price is written on a page, quote it exactly as written there.
- When the pages do not give a price, use the callback response in [answers.mdc](answers.mdc).
